            <title>[IGNITE-6722] Marshaller mappings and binary metadata must be merged and written to disk on registerLocally</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6722</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Each mapping/metadata register operation must result in creating/updating corresponding file in file system.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Methods for local register (&lt;tt&gt;MarshallerContext::registerClassNameLocally&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;CacheObjectBinaryProcessor::addMetaLocally&lt;/tt&gt;) lack this part.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
